# Expo Mobile

## Routing

Tabs: `(tabs)/index`, `more`, `spots`, `futures`. Stack: `/results`, `/rate-review`.

## Data fetching

- `@tanstack/react-query` for REST
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` base
- `useSignalRealtime` → invalidate queries on WS events

## Components

- `SignalCard` — Spots/Futures live (OPEN/ACTIVE) only
- `ClosedSignalCard` — Results only
- Never show CANCELLED signals

## Menu

Render from `GET /settings/menu`. No hardcoded menu list.
- `EXTERNAL_LINK` → `Linking.openURL`
- `INTERNAL_ROUTE` → `router.push`

## Push

Register via `POST /devices/register` only. Not via WebSocket.

## Theme

Dark-first: bg `#0A0A0F`, cards `#1E1E24`, accent `#3B82F6`.

## Types

Import from `@qpulse/shared`. Never duplicate DTOs locally.
